8046\" data-vbnamecard=\"28046\">Maroon_Mumba</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-25T06:22:59-07:00","id":1521377,"title":"","content":"Hey, just checking in on people.<br /> <br /> I think <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28046-maroon_mumba\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar28046_1.webp');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28046\" data-vbnamecard=\"28046\">Maroon_Mumba</a> was wanting to finish up a scene with Isla, and then we should all be ready to unite the party in Buenos Aires. Katab ( <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar26736_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26736\" data-vbnamecard=\"26736\">TempleBuilder</a> ) and Gawain ( <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> ) should be arriving together, Gilad ( <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> ) , Utopia, and Trish will be arriving together, and Blackfish has his own way of getting to Argentina.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-07T09:44:47-07:00","id":1522221,"title":"","content":"OK. Well...<br /> I think we will move on to the the first scene in Buenos Aires, unless there are any strong objections.<br /> <br /> You all will be in the home of the hierarch of the city's southern concilium. There is a large party being held for his granddaughter's <i>fiesta de quince\u200b</i>. Trish is covering the event as a travel and culture reporter and Utopia is one of the performing music groups. Gawain and Katab have also been invited to the celebration, and you will all be invited up to the hierarch's private office at some point in the evening.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-07T12:08:11-07:00","id":1522227,"title":"","content":"Yep, Gilad doesn't know Trish enough to comment on the situation properly, and it was said that the situation was unusual, so he isn't sure if &quot;you did well&quot; would actually be true.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-14T12:48:13-07:00","id":1522590,"title":"","content":"Sorry. IRL stuff happened. I'll post something this evening.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-14T13:00:40-07:00","id":1522592,"title":"","content":"Everyone take a beat for changing locations. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar26736_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26736\" data-vbnamecard=\"26736\">TempleBuilder</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> take an additional beat each for fulfilling aspirations &quot;Make a deal&quot; and &quot;Help spread stories about the past.&quot; And <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar26736_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26736\" data-vbnamecard=\"26736\">TempleBuilder</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> can have an arcane beat each for following their obsessions.<br /> <br /> Also, from earlier...<br /> <br /> <br /> I'm going to say that Gilad takes on a &quot;Lost in Time&quot; condition. Every time he fails to recognize a social cue or some detail because of his unfamiliarity with his temporal surroundings (wits+composure or relevant skill) he can choose to take a beat, up to five per chapter. The condition resolves when he gains some understanding the modern world by successfully opening a social door or finding an investigation clue.<br /> <br /> I'm going to give Katab and Gawain the informed condition on their next investigative roll for dealing with the abyssal intrusion in Buenos Aires.<br /> <br /> Clues so far<br /> (For Katab) It has something to do with the book that he found a castoff of. &quot;The Angelic Choir of the Virgin&quot;.<br /> (For Gawain) Caliburn thinks it has something to do with Annunaki and seductive &quot;singing&quot;.\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-14T13:32:28-07:00","id":1522594,"title":"","content":"Utopia and Trish arrive in Buenos Aires. For some reason when they checked in at the airport in Paris, everyone got bumped up to first class. Trish seemed just as surprised as everyone else.<br /> <br /> Buenos Aires is often described as the Paris of the South. It in many ways resembles a large European city that has been transported to the southern hemisphere. While not ancient by European standards, it has been around for a little over 500 years and has many old buildings and monuments. It has an ancient graveyard that is regarded as one of the more splendid cemeteries in the world. Argentina is in the midst of a terrible economic ressesion with very high inflation and a poor exchange rate. There is an upcoming presidential election, and everyone seems a little...on edge. People seem happy to see tourists however, especially ones with Euros and US dollars.<br /> <br /> Utopia are staying at an AirBNB in a reasonably priced neighborhood. Trish has her own accommodations somewhere else in the city.<br /> <br /> Katab and Gawain are staying near the University in very shabby, rundown, and small apartment that is owned by the Mysterium.<br /> <br /> Blackfish showed up on shore soaked in seawater and began wandering the streets of the city at night looking for his friend Katab, not having a clue where they actually live because he has only met them in the Astral Realm. Within a few hours he was picked up by some dudes in masks who asked him to get into a van with them.<br /> <br /> Gilad and the rest of Utopia are scheduled to play at music festival in about a week, but Lucas has also booked them some gigs at a few local bars and caf\u00e9s as well. They have been invited to play at a birthday party for daughter of an important local businessman. Lucas informed the rest of the band that this is actually a cover for a convocation of the city's consilia.<br /> <br /> There are three consilla and a Free Council assembly. The convocation is being held at the home of the hierarch of the concilium in the south part of the city, an old Silver Ladder patrician who has been in leadership since the 1940's. It is a large house that might be confused for a French chateau.<br /> <br /> Katab and Gawain where invited to see the concilium who would like their advise on an important matter.<br /> <br /> When all of your characters arrive, the party is just beginning. There are many children and teenagers there and older people sitting watching the young people have fun and dance. Most likely the young adults will arrive latter. Argentinians like to party all night, so things will probably not really start to heat up until around midnight. There is a buffet and a very nice cake and other deserts. This is a very fancy party and there are servants everywhere going around with drinks and hors d'oeuvres. Lucas coordinates with one of the house staff about setting up the band's equipment in the courtyard where the dance floor is.<br /> <br /> Would any of you like to do anything at the party before you meet with the hierarch and council?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 09-14-2023, 04:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-17T18:38:03-07:00","id":1522730,"title":"","content":"Since its not polite by Swedish etiquette to take a gift to a place of business (the Convocation), Gilad will instead have a custom pins made for himself and place it in his clothes when they move to mage company: A pin with an image of the deer humanoid from his Awakening, with the suit and the glass. Because that may either draw attention from a lead or might be a great conversation starter, either one is a win in his eyes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 09-17-2023, 11:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-18T10:58:26-07:00","id":1522753,"title":"","content":"Great! Go ahead and roll presence + expression.<br /> <br /> Edit: I'm asking for expression rather than socialize since it is an art piece rather than an action. The effect will be similar to &quot;gain attention&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 09-18-2023, 02:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-18T11:04:18-07:00","id":1522754,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar26736_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26736\" data-vbnamecard=\"26736\">TempleBuilder</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> This would be a good time to place your characters in the scene. Perhaps Katab and Gawain notice Gilad while the band is setting up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-23T14:56:54-07:00","id":1523050,"title":"","content":"Roger that, so Presence [3] and Expression [3]:<br /> <br /> <b>10</b>, <b>9</b>, <b>9</b>, 6, 6, 1, 7 = 3 successes.<br /> <br /> So I believe that should allow making a fairly competent pin, maybe hide a High Speech rune into the style of the background to help people understand the symbolism easier.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-24T11:15:49-07:00","id":1523086,"title":"","content":"Sorry if this is a bit late, but Katab would want to meet up with any local Mystagorges for rumors and a brief on local protocols so they don't make the Mysterium look bad. They also made sure to refresh their memory of everything about the Castoff. Is a Death Fraying good enough to remove the haze (aka decay) on old memories? I think it would be kinda like a Deathy version of Perfect Recall?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-25T14:09:57-07:00","id":1523147,"title":"","content":"Hmm. That would be an interesting use of the Death Arcanum. I had to think for a little bit. It kind of goes to the question of what distinction the MtAw world/system makes between soul and mind. A mystery!<br /> <br /> I think if one wanted to go with the idea that a ghost is an echo, a kind of &quot;memory&quot;, then you could possibly use a death spell to summon or bolster a memory (it might look similar to summoning a goetia), but that would be Perfecting rather than Fraying. Give it a try and try to put an interesting description (meaning that it is somehow different than the effect of a Mind Unveiling) in the IC thread. Is this something you think Katab has tried before, or are they following a new hunch? If you succeed I'll give you an arcane beat for following Katab's obsession of finding connections between the Astral and the Underworld.<br /> <br /> Katab and Gawain meet with the curator for Athenaeum associated with the Barrio Sur Concilium who works as a docent for the Antiquities museum. Sendero tells you that there has been some recent event that has the councilors and Hierach concerned, but he doesn't know all the details. He thinks it has something to do with the tunnels underneath the city that connect some of the older churches. As far as protocols for the city he warns you to be careful if you travel to Astral Space as there are &quot;seismic anomalies&quot; in the Temenos of Buenos Aires. Sendero himself does a lot of research on Pre-Columbian mysteries and it sounds like your book has to do with European Colonial symbolism.<br /> <br /> He also reminds you to get a present for the great granddaughter. Something with religious significance (Bible, Rosary, Cross, etc.) is traditional, but modern kids these days...who knows what they want?<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> Anything you want to add?<br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28046-maroon_mumba\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar28046_1.webp');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28046\" data-vbnamecard=\"28046\">Maroon_Mumba</a> you still with us?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 09-25-2023, 05:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-25T14:35:42-07:00","id":1523149,"title":"","content":"Just posted in the IC thread. Any of you are welcome to go next. I'm going with the idea that you are all in the same location.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-25T20:37:31-07:00","id":1523160,"title":"","content":"Is there a safe place (perhaps with some local Arrows) that Gawain can stash his broadsword? I'm assuming that it would not be polite to bring it to the party.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan","name":"nickeldan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-26T06:13:19-07:00","id":1523171,"title":"","content":"Why would you assume that a 155 cm Scottish claymore would be out of place at a 15 year-old girl's birthday party?<br /> <br /> Let's say that the coat room attendant was very understanding when you arrived. Barely even raised an eyebrow. It's in a room near the front door of the house if you should need to retrieve it during the evening.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-30T11:30:13-07:00","id":1523362,"title":"","content":"You raise a good point on whether Katab would think of such a solution. I would wager that Katab would think of Death as governing Pancryptia, and other non-magical processes of Information Entropy. Whether they are right or not is up to you. I believe that Ghosts as Trauma could work, but I'm fairly certain that summoning on of Katab's memories would require Patterning, which is currently out of Katab's reach. I vaguely remember Dave Brookshaw commenting on a thread that Death could directly restore a memory, but I can't place it at the moment. Could be misremembering, so until I find that thread, I would prefer to go with your interpretation.<br /> <br /> Owing to the current ambiguity of whether the idea is even possible, I propose a slightly different tack that Katab could go with. Namely, a *minor* Astral journey to the Realm of Katab's Memories of the events around the Castoff. If we go with this idea, should we roleplay the entirety of it? or should I just write Katab thinking about the events within the Onerios before having the rest of the post be about the party?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-30T13:59:59-07:00","id":1523368,"title":"","content":"I think that would be a good idea, meditate into Katab's Oneiros, find the memory and then use Death to clear away the entropy of the area.<br /> <br /> Alternatively, requisition a <i>Perfect Recall </i>cast or imbued item, its within the Mysterium's specialties, so it should be easy to get.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-01T00:58:52-07:00","id":1523394,"title":"","content":"Death perfecting should be within the ability of a Disciple of Death. But if you prefer to go into Katab's Oneiros that's fine too.<br /> <br /> If you choose to do that while in Beuenos Aires, maybe wait until after the current scene. Given the astral anomalies of the city it might be an interesting adventure.<br /> <br /> Or if you prefer to have done it before hand, maybe you can relate what you found to Gawain. I am trying to get some player character interaction going.<br /> <br /> Do you feel as a player that you have the information you need about the cast off, or are you looking for something that hasn't yet been discussed?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-01T19:14:19-07:00","id":1523448,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1517871-songs-for-the-dead-mtaw2e-ooc?p=1523171#post1523171\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why would you assume that a 155 cm Scottish claymore would be out of place at a 15 year-old girl's birthday party?<br /> <br /> Let's say that the coat room attendant was very understanding when you arrived. Barely even raised an eyebrow. It's in a room near the front door of the house if you should need to retrieve it during the evening.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Why would it be ? Swords are a sign of high status, you need to go under a stone to find one, doubly so if they have gold or silver filigree, now that costs strawberries. We are wearing these ceremonial suits and fancy nooses. A fine blade not being the perfect complement to one's outfit just goes over one's dandruff&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-02T15:24:55-07:00","id":1523477,"title":"","content":"So Katab ( <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar26736_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26736\" data-vbnamecard=\"26736\">TempleBuilder</a>) and Gawain ( <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> ) are in the coat check area stowing Gawain's sword. Blackfish ( <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28046-maroon_mumba\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar28046_1.webp');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28046\" data-vbnamecard=\"28046\">Maroon_Mumba</a> ) is in the garden contemplating escape of some kind, and wishing he knew where his friend Katab was. And Gilad ( <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> ) is speaking with a mysterious old woman in the main courtyard while the band is setting up.<br /> <br /> Many other guests are beginning to arrive. Amelia, the great granddaughter who is celebrating her 15th birthday, will be arriving soon from the church and then the party will really get going. It is a major cultural event, lots of important people, both mages and sleepers will be in attendance, and a certain reporter is likely to show up soon. It is about seven in the evening, the sun is setting, and it is five hours till midnight.<br /> <br /> At some point in the evening the hierarch and councilors will want to speak with Katab and Gawain, and also have another meeting with Utopia about the Arrow circle's business in Argentina, which concerns the whole region and is one of the main reasons for the convocation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-03T19:23:42-07:00","id":1523520,"title":"","content":"So far as he knows, the person in the cloak vanished at some point before reality flooded in Gilad's Awakening, he has no idea where they were &quot;dropped off&quot;, since Gilad was focusing on intuiting what to do by following the rhythm of the land.<br /> <br /> So far as he knows, this person might have unearthed that mage's research and that is somehow important to her current Mystery.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-04T00:45:40-07:00","id":1523535,"title":"","content":"If you're wanting to sense the old woman with the Rook cane's motives give me wits + empathy.<br /> <br /> As it stands right now, she seems to be saying that Gilad would have to find Katab to find out more about the contents of the book.<br /> <br /> As to the larger mystery of Gilad's awakening, the key information that you would need is who orchestrated the mystery play, and why they intended to push, or pull, Erik forward in time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-04T07:41:02-07:00","id":1523549,"title":"","content":"Sure, Gilad isn't a diplomat, but there is no harm in trying. Wits (2) + Empathy (-1 since its untrained):<br /> <br />